\">to be</span> plus a verb with <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Subject</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb to be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb (+ing) </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"staying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I am sending the invitation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You are staying with me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "With some verbs, you need to change the spelling when you add <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are the rules:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb ending in ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">How to make the -ing form </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"one vowel + one consonant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"double the consonant, then add -ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sit - sitting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"one vowel + one consonant + E or Y\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"remove E or Y, then add -ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"leave - leaving\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to start   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is starting to drizzle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about e-mails.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "umbrella ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thing we use to cover ourselves from the rain ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is raining. Do you have an umbrella?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shower ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small amount of rain for a short time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is raining ... maybe it is only a shower.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to leave ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go away from a place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My yoga class is soon. I am leaving in a minute.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to stay ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remain in a place; to not leave ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is raining. I am staying here!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inside ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "located in something or some place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is raining ... I'm staying inside.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "outside  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "located out of something or some place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is raining outside.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob08re1img01.jpg ", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Decide on a topic. (What is the e-mail about? School? Work?)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a greeting like <span class=\"italic\">Hi, ________</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Write an e-mail using casual language.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "End the e-mail with a friendly farewell.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I decide on a topic.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a casual e-mail to a friend and I use informal language in it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a greeting and a friendly farewell in my e-mail.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le03ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tHey, Peter. What are you doing?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI am checking my e-mail. There is an e-mail from my friend, John.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tWhat does it say?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tHe's asking about job applications.", "time": "7300"}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tI see. Are you replying?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tYes. There is a new book at the bookstore called,  <span class = \"italic\">Getting That Job</span>. I'm sending him the information on it. There is a review online.", "time": "13750"}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tWell, I am going to yoga class. I'm leaving in a minute.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tLook outside. It is starting to drizzle.  Do you have an umbrella?\n<br ><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tOh, no. Yoga is in the park today. I don't want to go outside!", "time": "26850"}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tMaybe it is only a shower ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tI am staying inside. Let's write the e-mail to John together.", "time": "45000"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "&bull; A casual e-mail", "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "&bull; John's e-mail", "time": "16000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "&bull; Remember to ...", "time": "73000"}], "video_src": "engenn2le03ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}, {"id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le03ob08re2aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn2le03ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], 