\n <span class=\"italic bullet\"> Write a casual e-mail to a friend about a job. For example, John's e-mail says: </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Hey Pete, ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; What's new? I need your help! ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; You know the bookstore near Ned's Cafe? They're hiring!", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; I need a part-time job. College is expensive.      ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; I'm filling in a job application right now.  There are a lot of questions.<br> The interview is on Thursday. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;  What do I write? Do you have any ideas?", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Your buddy,", "type": "text"}, {"content": " &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; John", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, select the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> <span class=\"italic\">button</span>.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content":